From: Chris Wiggins <chris@cwiggs.com>
Subject: [PATCH] 3rdparty/blobs: Update Fizz ECRW

Pin Fizz builds to the MrChromebox 26.09 hotfix blobs revision that provides
fizz_v1.1.7936-baf4587. In addition to preserving USB-PD power across an EC
RO-to-RW sysjump, this image fixes previous-power-state detection on Fizz.

The image comes from MrChromebox coreboot commit 47461fe6c788 ("blobs: pull
in ECRW update for fizz"), which advances the blobs submodule to commit
7fc4c0d16459 ("fizz: fix previous power state detection").

The blobs repository is configured with update=none, so fetch and check out
the pinned revision explicitly after initializing the submodule. Fail the
build instead of silently using a different EC image if checkout fails.

Link: https://github.com/MrChromebox/coreboot/commit/47461fe6c788b4529b266315de92a3b3f21276ba
Link: https://github.com/coreboot/blobs/commit/7fc4c0d16459a73f0e4c1eb5ef4289a2fdaa1601
Signed-off-by: Chris Wiggins <chris@cwiggs.com>
---
 Makefile.mk | 11 +++++++++++
 1 file changed, 11 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Makefile.mk b/Makefile.mk
--- a/Makefile.mk
+++ b/Makefile.mk
@@ -258,6 +258,17 @@ ifeq ($(CONFIG_USE_BLOBS),y)
 # These items are necessary because each has update=none in .gitmodules.  They are ignored
 # until expressly requested and enabled with --checkout
 forgetthis:=$(shell git submodule update --init --checkout 3rdparty/blobs $(quiet_errors))
+ifeq ($(CONFIG_BOARD_GOOGLE_FIZZ),y)
+fizz_blobs_commit:=7fc4c0d16459a73f0e4c1eb5ef4289a2fdaa1601
+ifneq ($(shell git -C 3rdparty/blobs rev-parse HEAD),$(fizz_blobs_commit))
+forgetthis:=$(shell \
+	git -C 3rdparty/blobs fetch --quiet origin $(fizz_blobs_commit) && \
+	git -C 3rdparty/blobs checkout --quiet --detach $(fizz_blobs_commit))
+endif
+ifneq ($(shell git -C 3rdparty/blobs rev-parse HEAD),$(fizz_blobs_commit))
+$(error Failed to check out Fizz blobs revision $(fizz_blobs_commit))
+endif
+endif
 forgetthis:=$(shell git submodule update --init --checkout 3rdparty/intel-microcode $(quiet_errors))
 ifeq ($(CONFIG_FSP_USE_REPO),y)
 forgetthis:=$(shell git submodule update --init --checkout 3rdparty/fsp $(quiet_errors))
-- 
